<title>HONG KONG: Cathay Inv Fund 1996 net returns to gain.</title>
<headline>Cathay Inv Fund 1996 net returns to gain.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   24.8 gain    vs 5.6 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    15.78	  vs 10.13</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    20.09 profit vs 4.00 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     58.84	  vs 25.52</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cathay Investment Fund Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 2</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 7</p>
<p>NOTE - Cathay Investment is an investment company specialising in unlisted Chinese companies or enterprises.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 15.78 H.K. cents vs 10.13 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
